  <name>Irida</name>
  <summary>Design a colour palette and apply it to COSMIC</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Irida is a palette designer for the COSMIC desktop. Pick a palette, draft
      one from a wallpaper, or edit its thirteen roles by hand while the preview
      and the contrast ratios follow every change.
    </p>
    <p>
      Apply it to the COSMIC desktop, COSMIC Terminal, btop, Neovim, fastfetch,
      lsd, zsh and cava in one step, and undo it in one step. Link a dark and a
      light palette as a pair, compare with saved versions, and export a
      complete rice repository. A panel applet applies any saved palette with
      one click.
    </p>
  </description>
  <developer id="io.github.atraxsrc">
    <name>atraxsrc</name>
  </developer>
